<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC,Swiss post to offer investment funds.</title>
<headline>SBC,Swiss post to offer investment funds.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss postal authority, as part of its cooperation with Swiss Bank Corp (SBC) will begin marketing investment funds through its 3,700 postal offices as of September 22, SBC and the postal authority said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The three funds will be designed to conform to Swiss law. They will invest in Swiss franc bonds, money market paper and equities.</p>
<p>Launch of the funds is subject to Swiss Banking Commission approval. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
